item: P1+P2+P3 — Swift Punycode encoder + fuzz + bench
date: 2026-04-26T00:00:00Z
author: jelmer@gcb.io

## Files created

- scheme/swift/common/punycode.go          (P1 — encoder + decoder, 183 LOC)
- scheme/swift/common/punycode_test.go     (P2 — table tests + 2 fuzz targets, 164 LOC)
- scheme/swift/common/punycode_bench_test.go (P3 — 2 benchmarks on 1000-entry corpus, 61 LOC)

